ests cover related owner rules but not this exact “chain unregistered + TMC listed on first refresh” tuple (**inferred**). Prefer keeping those three assertions or folding them into a shared helper used by T9/SN7 so the 2026-10-25 chain-wins rule stays pinned.\n\n## Owner rules\n\nChain-wins semantics remain implemented in `_merge_sources` (**measured**). The diff weakens how tightly tests enforce that rule on first-cycle validity metadata, not the implementation.\n\n## Settled\n\nNo roadmap/docs in this fixture tree; owner rule text in test docstrings and `_merge_sources` comment is the settled source (**measured**).",
