            "body": "## Summary\n\nPR replaces `(now - started).total_seconds() >= STALE_GRACE_SECONDS` with `elapsed.seconds >= STALE_GRACE_SECONDS` in `_eligible_for_removal`. **Measured** from `internal/subnet_universe.py` at head: `STALE_GRACE_SECONDS = 172800` (48h). **Inferred** from Python’s `timedelta` API: `.seconds` is only the sub-day component (0–86399); whole days live in `.days` and are excluded from `.seconds`. Therefore `elapsed.seconds >= 172800` is never true, so a deregistered subnet (probe `False`, `negative_since` set) never becomes eligible for removal; `_shrink_allowed` stays false and the universe retains stale members indefinitely.\n\n## Deregistered subnet: old vs new at concrete elapsed times\n\nAssume fixed `started` and `now = started + Δ`, with `probe is False` and valid `negative_since` (other guards pass).\n\n| Elapsed | `total_seconds()` (base) | Base `_eligible_for_removal` | `elapsed.days` | `elapsed.seconds` (head) | Head `_eligible_for_removal` |\n|--------|---------------------------|------------------------------|----------------|---------------------------|------------------------------|\n| 23h | 82 800 | False (< 48h) | 0 | 82 800 | False |\n| 24h | 86 400 | False (< 48h grace) | 1 | **0** | False |\n| 25h | 90 000 | False | 1 | 3 600 | False |\n| 47h59m | 172 740 | False | 1 | 86 340 | False |\n| **48h** | **172 800** | **True** (grace met) | 2 | **0** | **False** |\n| 49h | 176 400 | True | 2 | 3 600 | False |\n\nAround **24h**: base correctly stays in grace (86 400 < 172 800). Head also stays False, but for the wrong reason once Δ ≥ 24h: the day rolls into `elapsed.days`, so `elapsed.seconds` resets (e.g. at exactly 24h it becomes 0, not 86 400).\n\nAround **48h**: base removes after grace. Head **never** flips True at 48h+ because `elapsed.seconds` tops out at 86 399 while the threshold is 172 800.\n\n**Blocking:** `never-expires` — negative rows never satisfy removal eligibility; unsafe shrink stays blocked forever for grace-expired deregistrations.\n\n## Entry point trace\n\n`_compute_membership` → `_eligible_for_removal` (grace gate) → `dropped` → `SnapshotBuilder.build` → `_shrink_allowed` in `refresh_once`. Wrong comparison poisons shrink decisions every refresh cycle.\n\n## Fix direction\n\nRestore `elapsed.total_seconds() >= STALE_GRACE_SECONDS` (or compare to `timedelta(seconds=STALE_GRACE_SECONDS)`). Do not use `.seconds` for multi-day grace.",
