x with `passTailAllowed` is the right fail-closed direction: caveat tails like “PASS, but …” no longer parse as PASS (**measured**).\n\n## Severity\n\nMissing pointer↔marker enforcement breaks the stated fail-closed contract and can let the gate treat a SimiBot comment as an MC verdict when the visible PASS line names a different head than the marker — **aborts-cycle** for gate progression.",
