gative`, `negative_since` unchanged (T0). |\n| **T0 + 48h00m00s** | Grace met (`172800 >= 172800`). N is **dropped** (`dropped[N]`), removed from `validity_map`, **shrunk out of `netuids`** even though the chain read never completed. |\n| **T0 + 49h** | Same as 48h boundary if building from T0 state: N **already removed**; no successful chain read required for removal. |\n\nMembership count may still include N through 47h59m59s because negative rows stay in `validity_map` until `_eligible_for_removal` (**measured** loop in `_compute_membership`).\n\n### Severity\n**P1 / blocking:** Treating probe failure as per-netuid `probe=False` poisons persisted `negative_since` and enables removal on grace while contract (2) requires retaining validity with **no** dereg clock when the chain read fails.\n\n### Skills\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | Traced incomplete `probe_map` → `False` → `_merge_sources` → `_eligible_for_removal` on real `SnapshotBuilder.build` / `_compute_membership` path | — |\n| owner-rules | Chain-wins negative is documented for a **complete** chain read; this diff applies equivalent evidence on **incomplete** reads | — |\n| settled-check | No roadmap/fixture doc in session; contract taken from review prompt | — |",
